{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44290","headline":"感兴 · 李冶","name":"感兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝云暮雨镇相随，去雁来人有返期。\n玉枕秪知长下泪，银灯空照不眠时。\n仰看明月翻含意，俯眄流波欲寄词。\n却忆初闻凤楼曲，教人寂寞复相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李冶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44290.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44290","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}